          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- Fix attempt for a Home Screen crash in 1.0.\n- Does nothing at all until you switch a piece on.\n- Crash guard: if the Home Screen goes down while BarText is starting, BarText switches itself off instead of leaving you in Safe Mode.\n- New Status row in Settings.",
          "useSpacing": true
